WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.380
Okay, yinzers, the Steelers game is almost on.

2
00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:05.420
Time to fire up Steel City Game Day.

3
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:06.500
Let’s check the Wire.

4
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:15.700
Feeling good about the black and gold this year.

5
00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:18.100
Okay, time to get the pregame picks in.

6
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:20.500
I wonder who’s going to get the crown today.

7
00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:23.700
Seems like Alex is always lucky
with this stuff, n’at.

8
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:36.900
Okay, Flash Picks are up. Yinz going yes or no?

9
00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:39.800
I don’t know. That defense looks tough.

10
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.700
Not sure the Steelers score before the half.

11
00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:47.200
Dang, it’s down to the wire.

12
00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:50.200
Who’s finishing on top in our crew?

13
00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:52.600
It better not be Alex.

14
00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:54.200
She always wins.

15
00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:01.800
Oh man, Alex took it.

16
00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:04.700
Alex took it. I knew it.

17
00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:10.960
Oh yes, took the crown for this game.

18
00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:15.000
Yinz better get used to it this season.

19
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:16.780
Oh well, at least the Steelers won.

20
00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:18.040
Time for an Iron City.

21
00:01:18.220 --> 00:01:22.400
Here we go, Steelers! Here we go!
